# Review requests. GitHub asks the listed owners to review any pull request
# that changes a matching path; the LAST matching line wins, so the
# path-specific lines sit below the default and name both owners rather
# than replace it. Dependabot's bumps touch exactly those paths, which is how
# they get an automatic reviewer (Dependabot's own `reviewers` key in
# dependabot.yml is deprecated in favour of this file). An owner needs write
# access to the repository for the request to be made.
*                           @NoahSaso
/bun.lock                   @ficusagent @NoahSaso
/package.json               @ficusagent @NoahSaso
/apps/*/package.json        @ficusagent @NoahSaso
/packages/*/package.json    @ficusagent @NoahSaso
/.github/workflows/         @ficusagent @NoahSaso
/.github/dependabot.yml     @ficusagent @NoahSaso
